WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
CR50L carton palletizing application
with a lifting column.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The tooling grips a carton from above
and transfers it to the work area.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Carton handling at the pallet stack.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The lifting-column workstation is arranged
beside conveyor and pallet positions.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The robot continues carton pickup
and transfer around the work area.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.967
The workstation includes a touchscreen
and visible status indicators.
